    {
      "id": "quads/all-fours-squad-stretch",
      "slug": "all-fours-squad-stretch",
      "name": "拉伸四肢小队",
      "muscle": "quads",
      "bodyPart": "legs",
      "equipment": "bodyweight",
      "category": "stretching",
      "secondaryMuscles": [],
      "instructions": [
        "以正确的身体排列就位——耳朵在肩膀上方，肩膀在髋部上方。",
        "缓慢移动到拉伸位置，直到感受到目标区域的轻柔拉力——不是疼痛。",
        "保持20到40秒，深呼吸。每次呼气时，尝试更深地沉入拉伸。",
        "缓慢释放，如需要可重复。坚持比强度更重要——定期拉伸获得持久柔韧性。",
        "在整个保持阶段深呼吸，保持均匀。拉伸时绝不要憋气。"
      ],
      "file": "quads/all-fours-squad-stretch.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/quads/all-fours-squad-stretch.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/quads/all-fours-squad-stretch.thumb.webp"
    },
